---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import Button from "../components/Button.astro";
import {publicProducts} from "../data/products";
---
<Base title="Support" description="Find setup help and approved release resources for BORGAS racing and diagnostic products."><section class="section"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Owner support</p><h1>Start with your product.</h1><p class="lede">Have the product code, hardware revision and software version ready. They help us match the guidance to your device.</p><section class="software-downloads" aria-labelledby="software-heading">
<p class="eyebrow">Windows software</p><h2 id="software-heading">Download. Install. Connect.</h2>
<p>Choose the app for your device. Click Download to save the installer, then open it and choose Install.</p>
<div class="grid grid-2">
<article class="panel"><h3>BORGAS Device Manager</h3><p>For BFD-01 and BPS-01 diagnostic devices. Manage your devices and install compatible firmware updates.</p><p class="small">Version 1.2.3 · Windows installer (.exe) · 21.2 MB<br/>Includes USB flashing tools.</p><Button href="https://github.com/borgas123/borgas-firmware/releases/download/BORGAS-Windows-Installers-2026-09-13/BORGAS-Device-Manager-Setup-1.2.3.exe">Download Device Manager</Button></article>
<article class="panel"><h3>BORGAS LED Configurator</h3><p>For BRC-02 and BRC-FL racing hardware. Choose dashboard layouts and configure LED colors and effects.</p><p class="small">Installer 1.0.0 · September 13, 2026 build · Windows (.exe) · 848 KB<br/>Includes all ten layout previews and the dashboard font.</p><Button href="https://github.com/borgas123/borgas-firmware/releases/download/BORGAS-Windows-Installers-2026-09-13/BORGAS-LED-Configurator-Setup-1.0.0.exe">Download LED Configurator</Button></article>
</div><p class="small">Requires Windows with .NET Framework 4.x. Installers create Start menu and optional desktop shortcuts. These packages are not yet digitally signed, so Windows may show an unknown-publisher warning.</p>
<p class="small"><a href="https://github.com/borgas123/borgas-firmware/releases/download/BORGAS-Windows-Installers-2026-09-13/SHA256SUMS.txt">Download SHA-256 checksums</a></p>
</section><nav class="filters" aria-label="Choose a support product">{publicProducts().map(p=><a href={"#"+p.slug}>{p.code}</a>)}</nav>{publicProducts().map(p=><article class="support-row" id={p.slug}><div><p class="eyebrow">{p.code}</p><h2>{p.name}</h2><p>{p.id==="brc-02"?"If the dashboard stays on standby, check that USB is connected to the native ESP32-S3 port and that SimHub is sending telemetry. The waiting caption distinguishes a missing connection from missing valid telemetry.":p.id==="brc-fl"?"The flag panel uses its own SimHub serial-device configuration. Its formula must match the dashboard's telemetry format.":"Match the device identity and hardware revision before installing firmware or following setup instructions."}</p></div><div><h3>Help & resources</h3>{p.resources.length?p.resources.map(r=><p><a href={r.href}>{r.title} ↗</a><br/><span class="small">{r.note} Release index and files hosted on GitHub; select the matching model and version there.</span></p>):<p>Contact BORGAS for the setup guide and files appropriate to your build.</p>}<div class="actions"><Button href={"/contact?product="+p.code+"&topic=Technical%20support"}>Ask about {p.code}</Button><a href={"/products/"+p.slug}>Product details</a></div></div></article>)}</div></section></Base>

<style>.software-downloads{margin:48px 0}.software-downloads .grid{margin:24px 0}.software-downloads .panel{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start}.software-downloads .panel :global(.btn){margin-top:auto}</style>
